OrbiterCrew. The honeycomb jet pack "—оты" on the KSC runway: the astronavigator in her suit, the honeycomb pack already on her back (G starts the power unit, then Space up), the light "Ќаплечный" 3 m west (it cannot lift her on Earth: T/W 0.77).
